{"c":[{"name":"20261022T043948Z-dab6d7cbfdabf68a","text":"Measured 2026-10-21: engine-default connects (autoload+autoinstall on) never load vss for a file with the HNSW index, ro or rw, with a killed embed's wal, on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. Same-path connects in one process share one instance and its loaded vss.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T043949Z-fa23510e4a10474a","text":"pragma_storage_info lists VALIDITY segments under the column name, Uncompressed or Constant even with zstd forced; check zstd on VARCHAR/JSON segments. Live tables copy to 288 MiB with zstd vs 483 MiB without on 2.0.0 (measured 2026-10-21).","type":"note"}]}
